#: tips.cpp:116
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can let Konsole set the current directory as the window "
"title?\n"
"For Bash, put 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/.bashrc "
